* Crypto hacks 2017
** Figures
*** CipherTrace: ~$266M stolen from exchanges
*** EY: ~10% of ICO funds lost or stolen
*** Chainalysis: ~$225M lost to Ethereum scams (Aug)
** Exchanges and services
*** NiceHash ~$64M (spear phishing, VPN)
*** Tether ~$31M (treasury wallet)
*** Korea: Yapizon, Coinis, YouBit, Bithumb
** Ethereum
*** Parity July ~$31M (re-initialised wallets)
*** CoinDash, Enigma: ICO sites hijacked
*** EtherDelta, Classic Ether Wallet: DNS
** Not counted
*** Accident: Parity freeze, 513,774 ETH
*** Enforcement: BTC-e seized
*** Frauds: Control-Finance, PlexCoin, Confido
